<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>About KAIZEN — Why We Exist</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main class="k-page-main">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="k-page-header k-grid-bg" data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow k-eyebrow--center">The Mission</div>
      <h1 class="k-page-h1">About <span class="k-gold">KAIZEN</span></h1>
      <p class="k-page-sub">
        Built by a trader, for traders. KAIZEN exists because the gap
        between knowing your rules and following them is where most
        accounts go to die.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <div class="k-problem" data-reveal>
      <div class="k-problem-eyebrow">
        <i data-feather="alert-triangle" width="14" height="14"></i>
        The Problem
      </div>
      <div class="k-problem-h">Most retail traders lose money.</div>
      <p>
        Not because of bad strategies. Not because of the market. Because
        of behavioral failures — FOMO entries, revenge trades, rule
        violations under pressure, overconfidence after wins. The strategy
        works. The execution does not.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THE SOLUTION -->
    <div class="k-solution">
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="k-eyebrow">The Solution</div>
        <h2 class="k-solution-h">
          Turn the invisible struggle into measurable improvement.
        </h2>
        <p>
          KAIZEN is a trader improvement platform. You plan your trades,
          journal your sessions, and reflect on what happened. The AI
          analyzes every entry against your own stated rules and your full
          history — so every response is specific to your behavior, your
          patterns, your triggers, your blind spots. Not a template. Not
          generic advice.
        </p>
        <p>
          The result is the KAIZEN Score: one number, five dimensions —
          Process, Risk, Execution, Behavior, Learning & Consistency.
          It measures how you trade, not what you made, because
          improvement is the one thing you can actually control.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="k-solution-panel k-card--elevated k-grid-bg" data-reveal style="transition-delay:100ms;">
        <%- include('partials/k-dial', { value: 87, size: 180, label: 'KAIZEN Score' }) %>
        <%- include('partials/k-meters', { meters: [
          ['Process', 91],
          ['Risk', 86],
          ['Execution', 88],
          ['Behavior', 82],
          ['Learning & Consistency', 90]
        ] }) %>
        <div class="k-solution-caption">One number. Five dimensions.<br>How you traded — not what you made.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOW IS THIS SCORED? (the Cockpit links here) -->
    <div id="kaizen-score" data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">The Score, Explained</div>
      <h2 class="k-title">How is this scored?</h2>
      <p class="k-sub k-sub--left">
        The KAIZEN Score is computed by a fixed formula from your sessions
        — never invented by the AI, never set by hand. It measures how you
        traded, not what you made. Every number shows its WHY, and when
        there isn't enough evidence yet, a dimension says <b>Building</b>
        instead of guessing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="k-pillars">
      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="clipboard" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Process</div>
          <p>Do you do what you said you would? Planning before the session, and trading inside your own written rules.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="shield" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Risk</div>
          <p>How responsibly you manage it — predefined risk, sizing, stops, and the daily limits you set for yourself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="crosshair" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Execution</div>
          <p>How closely the actual trade matched the plan you wrote beforehand — entries, exits, and the moments in between.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="zap" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Behavior</div>
          <p>The patterns behind your decisions — the impulses, the hesitations, the things that repeat when nobody is watching.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="trending-up" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Learning &amp; Consistency</div>
          <p>Whether experience is actually turning into improvement — real reflections, corrected mistakes, steadiness over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WHAT MAKES KAIZEN DIFFERENT -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">What Makes KAIZEN Different</div>
    </div>
    <div class="k-pillars">

      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="activity" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Behavioral AI, Not Signals</div>
          <p>
            KAIZEN never tells you what to trade. It tells you whether you
            followed your own process and identifies exactly where and why
            your discipline breaks down across sessions. The intelligence
            grows with every entry you log.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="heart" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Psychology, Not Just Trade Analysis</div>
          <p>
            A dedicated Psychology Session space lets you talk to KAIZEN AI
            about your mindset, fear of pulling the trigger, financial
            pressure, or self-doubt — not tied to any specific trade.
            Discipline failures are often rooted in psychology that never
            shows up in a trade log.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms;">
        <div class="k-seal">認</div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Progress You Can Prove</div>
          <p>
            Your improvement becomes a record. Session by session, your
            score history, your patterns, and your milestones build up —
            and the milestones that matter can become credentials that
            anyone can independently verify. Verification is the output of
            improvement, not a substitute for it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-pillar k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:180ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="user" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-pillar-title">Built From Real Experience</div>
          <p>
            KAIZEN was conceived from direct, personal experience with the
            exact discipline challenges it was built to solve. The
            multi-timeframe liquidity strategy that KAIZEN was designed to
            support is the same strategy the founder trades. This is not a
            tool built by observers. It was built from the inside.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- IDENTITY & VERIFICATION -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">Identity &amp; Verification · Optional</div>
      <h2 class="k-title">Verification, kept honest and optional</h2>
      <p class="k-sub k-sub--left">
        You never need a wallet to use KAIZEN. But if you want your
        progress to be provable, verification is there.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="k-verify-grid">

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="link" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Wallets</h3>
        <p>
          Connect a Stacks, Ethereum, or other supported wallet to verify
          your identity. Private by default — your address is never shown
          publicly unless you decide otherwise. A verified wallet proves
          you control your address. It says nothing about your trading
          results, and we never pretend otherwise.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Stacks · Ethereum · More</span>
      </div>

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--featured" data-reveal style="transition-delay:80ms;">
        <div class="k-seal">認</div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Credentials</h3>
        <p>
          Milestones you earn — consistency streaks, process adherence,
          recovery comebacks — can be recorded on the Mantle blockchain,
          so your credentials can be independently verified by anyone.
          Your journal text is never written to any blockchain.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Recorded on Mantle · Testnet</span>
      </div>

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:160ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="globe" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Web3 Reputation</h3>
        <p>
          Already active in Web3? Link your Zero Authority profile to add
          that reputation to your KAIZEN identity. Entirely optional — for
          traders who just want the journaling and coaching, nothing
          changes.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Optional</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- MISSION -->
    <div class="k-quote" data-reveal>
      <blockquote>
        "KAIZEN scores process, not P&amp;L — because improvement is the
        one thing you can actually control."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="k-quote-tag">Trade Better. Every Day.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="k-page-cta" data-reveal>
      <a href="/auth/register" class="btn-primary k-btn-lg">Start Building Your Improvement Record</a>
      <p class="k-page-cta-note">Free to start · No credit card · No signals</p>
    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/v2-reveal.js"></script>
  <script>if (window.feather) feather.replace();</script>
</body>
</html>
